ind":"update","title":"XP Collection Update – New Tech Tree Upgrades!","summary":"XP Collection Update – New Tech Tree Upgrades! The battlefield just got more rewarding! We've introduced a new XP collection system to Astro Company, giving you more reasons to stay active during combat and new ways to customize your progression. ✨ XP Now Drops on the Battlefield! Defeated enemies now drop XP directly onto the battlefield! Move your cursor over XP drops to collect them and earn experience. The more enemies you destroy, the more XP you'll see scattered across the battlefield. Eve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:43:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696213","verified_at":"2026-10-21T03:34:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1846651706673479","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 The Astro Company Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"🚀 The Astro Company Demo Is Now Available! The wait is over the Astro Company demo is now live on Steam! After months of development, updates, playtesting, feedback, and more changes than I can count, you can finally jump in and try the game for yourself. Build. Adapt. Survive. In Astro Company, you defend your Core against increasingly dangerous waves of enemies. Draw your own enemy routes, build your defenses around them, combine towers with powerful Booster Pads, unlock permanent upgrades thr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:42:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1846018067944919","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"update","title":"🚀 Major Update – A New Way to Build","summary":"🚀 Major Update – A New Way to Build Astro Company’s building system has received one of its biggest changes yet. Enemy routes are no longer just something you draw for enemies to follow — they now directly shape where your defenses can be built. 🛠️ NEW – Strategic Build Slots Combat towers are now built on dedicated positions generated around your enemy routes. How you draw your path now directly affects your available building space. A clean route can provide plenty of strong defensive position","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:45:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1846018067930934","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"update","title":"Astro Company – Update 0.6 | Targeting & Bug Fixes","summary":"Astro Company – Update 0.6 | Targeting & Bug Fixes Update 0.6 is here! This update focuses on improving tower targeting, fixing several gameplay issues, and making the overall experience smoother and more reliable. Thanks to everyone who has been testing Astro Company and reporting bugs. Your feedback is helping us improve the game with every update! 🎯 Targeting Improvements Focus Until Death – Added a new targeting mode that keeps towers focused on their target until it's destroyed. Fixed an is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:58:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930934","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1845383656381469","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"update","title":"🚀 Tower Cards Update is here!","summary":"🚀 Tower Cards Update is here! A new Astro Company update is now live! This update expands the roguelike side of the game with 22 new Tower Cards, while also introducing a tutorial, new upgrades, improved controls and another round of gameplay fixes and polishing. 🃏 22 New Tower Cards 22 new cards have been added for your towers! The new cards give you more ways to improve and specialize your defenses during a run, opening up more combinations and builds as you progress through the waves. Experim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T14:08:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1844115010504785","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"update","title":"OPEN PLAYTEST IS LIVE! — Enemy Rarities & Major Update","summary":"🚀 Open Playtest + Enemy Rarities Are Here! The Astro Company Playtest is now open to everyone! No invitation is required anymore — you can join the Playtest directly from the Steam page. This update also introduces a new system that makes later waves more varied and dangerous. ☄️ New Enemy Rarity System Enemies can now spawn in different rarities: Common Uncommon Rare Legendary Higher-rarity enemies are significantly more dangerous and scale beyond their standard variants. Their visual scale als","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T16:31:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504785","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1834602721192065","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #4 – The Core Fights Back","summary":"Devlog #4 – The Core Fights Back Hey everyone! This update is focused on making Astro Company feel smoother, more reactive and more replayable. I’ve been working on performance, new cards, balance changes and several smaller improvements that should make the game feel better during longer runs. Performance Improvements One of the biggest goals for this update was improving performance during larger waves. Since Astro Company is an endless tower defense game, the screen can quickly become filled ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T21:29:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721192065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1824459501602442","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 Devlog #2 – Scaling an Endless Tower Defense Without Killing Performance","summary":"🚀 Devlog #2 – Scaling an Endless Tower Defense Without Killing PerformanceHey everyone 👋 I want to share a deeper look at what I’ve been working on recently, because this update touches the core of the game more than anything else so far.When you’re building an endless tower defense, things work great at first… until the enemy count starts going up. Fast.⚠️ The Problem: Endless Waves, Finite PerformanceEarly versions of the game handled enemies in a fairly straightforward way. Each enemy was its","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-11T01:27:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824459501602442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1818118366179358","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"update","title":"50+ New Cards, 30 New Artifacts, Performance Boost & Playtest Update!","summary":"Today we are excited to release the biggest update so far for ASTROCOMPANY: More than 50 new cards, over 30 new artifacts, massive performance improvements, and a fully updated Playtest build now available on Steam.This update expands build variety, late-game chaos, and the number of possible broken synergies you can discover.New Artifact SystemArtifacts are powerful, passive upgrades that can dramatically change how your towers behave. They are run-defining, chaotic, and often completely break ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-06T16:40:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366179358","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1814309641422445","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"announcement","title":"Astro Company Playtest is now live!","summary":"Astro Company Playtest is now live!We’re excited to announce that the Astro Company Playtest is officially open! If you’ve requested access, keep an eye on your Steam client – we’re starting to grant access to testers.Join the Playtest and help us shape the future of Astro Company with your feedback. Every bug report, suggestion, and idea helps us improve the game before Early Access.Head over to the steam page and click Request Access if you haven’t already. Let’s see how long you can survive o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-22T21:23:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641422445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4042610-1811772772446836","game_id":"steam-4042610","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re Live on Steam!","summary":"Our Steam page is now officially live! This is the first big step on our journey, and we’d love your support.Add the game to your Wishlist and be the first to know when we launch Early Access!Wishlist now!Thank you for joining us from the very beginning. More updates, screenshots, and devlogs are coming soon – stay tuned!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-01T15:57:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772446836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4042610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4042610":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4042610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z"},"4083040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:51Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4042610","app_id":4042610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3adf636a8c28c3b8598cde70c1ec95f6ab055c5735b33eec3beda4f271ae74bf","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build the path. Defend the Core. Combine towers, cards, and artifacts into broken synergies in an endless tower defense roguelike.","publishers":[{"name":"Elephant Arts"}],"developers":[{"name":"Elephant Arts"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Astro Company Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791926680","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"40426